{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_02",
  "title": "沙海黃塵",
  "storyCode": "WB-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "772f483858095002d79ee791489a5c1ab2cd1d66b1e9b2507deefc8c74e9fc13",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "躺下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）你是什麼人？！我為什麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我聽不懂你在說什麼。算了，聽不懂也不要緊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你只許在這裡養傷，吃喝起居、一舉一動都得聽醫生的。醫生不在，那就得聽我的。否則，小命不保。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "（有些生硬的炎國語）這是哪......？你是誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "這是醫館，你是病人，我是醫館的夥計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "我的劍呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女緊張地四處摸索，直到手掌觸碰到身旁的古劍，才慢慢放鬆下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "還好......還在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "昨晚你倒在醫館門口，昏迷不醒，還緊緊抱著這把劍不鬆開。你是為了搶這個東西才受傷的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "......和你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "不用這麼看著我。我要是想搶，早趁你昏迷的時候把東西拿走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "見多了為一件所謂的絕世神兵不要命的人，實在無聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你們真的相信，靠一件兵器就能實力大增，打敗自己原本打不過的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我就從不相信兵器，我只相信自己的拳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "習武之人，把勝負寄託於外物，就已經落了下乘。不好，不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "你不明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "我才不是要用這把劍去打架......我......是為了報恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我只曉得劍能用來殺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "師父說，這把劍對她有很特殊的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "我和她約定好了，要把這把劍帶給她。如果她不在了，也要將這把劍帶到她的墳前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你說的師父，是已經離世了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "恩恩怨怨沒完沒了，我也沒興趣聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你說搶劍是為了報恩，那我就相信你。一個險些丟了命的人，應該犯不著說謊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "所以說，你將這把劍看得比命重要，其實是把別人的恩情看得比命重要，是個重情義的人。那倒不錯，不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "......你們為什麼要救我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "醫館救人難道不是天經地義？哪來那麼多為什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "可我沒有錢，我知道，對生活在移動城市裡的人來說，接受別人的恩惠，是要付錢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "欠債還錢的道理倒是沒錯，但是沒錢也不打緊，幫醫生幹活也可以抵帳。不然你以為我為什麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "但我和你可不一樣，我賠的是被我打傷的人的醫藥費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "醫館裡的體力活有我幹了，你可以去曬曬草藥，學學包紮之類的。你欠的錢也沒我多，三兩個月總能還清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "你們救我的恩情，我會再還。但是現在，我很趕時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "我一定要出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "不許動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我說了，現在你只許好好養傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "受這麼重的傷都活了下來，要是在醫館養傷的時候死了，你丟人，醫館也丟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "嗯......但是話說回來，報恩的事也很要緊。等你養好了傷還清了債，我再考慮要不要幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "又有病人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我去看看，你不要亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "是你敲門，有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "先生是這家醫館的醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "醫生有事出去了，我是這裡的夥計。看病要等醫生回來，買藥現在就能買。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "抱歉打擾。玉門軍方查案緝凶，有權杖在此，煩請先生如實回答我的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你問，我看心情回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "這座醫館，從昨夜到今晨，是否收治或見過被銳器重創的病人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "沒收過，沒見過。要買藥便買，不買就走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "還請允許我進去檢查。結束後在下立即離開，絕不多打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "不行，不是病人，又不買藥，一概不許進醫館。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "醫館行救死扶傷之責，在玉門素來受人敬重，在下絕不願意硬闖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "事關整座玉門城安危，希望先生配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "囉哩囉嗦，有什麼好說的。你有你的規矩，我也有我的規矩，不許進就是不許進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "那就恕在下失禮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是羽獸投林，左樂的身法很快。\n可在越入醫館大門的前一瞬，他被一股怪力拎住衣領，扔回了原地。\n那魁梧大漢仍站在他面前，好像連動都沒動過。\n他是輕快的羽獸，但撞上了一張無形且無邊際的大網。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "（這大漢竟有如此身手？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "小子！我說了不許進去，你找死嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "先生可明白，妨礙公務的下場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "不明白也不想明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "有本事你再飛一次，進去了算你的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......別胡鬧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "裡面還有人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "嗯？不對，剛才那女娃又去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房間雜亂，扔在桌上的繃帶和棉團都還未收拾，病榻留有餘溫。\n空氣中混著血腥氣的草藥味隱隱刺鼻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......剛剛問先生，先生給出的答覆是這段時間並未收治重傷的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "那這些紗布和血跡怎麼解釋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "唉，唉！說了讓她不要亂跑，偏偏和人作對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "對了，記得她說是要出城來著，她一定是往城門口去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "不好，不好。萬萬不能讓病人走丟了，不然欠醫生的藥錢又得拖了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱情的吆喝聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看看茶葉，尚蜀岩茶，勾吳花茶，姜齊白茶，還有大荒城的粗葉子......您想喝的全都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "來兩車龍門的綠茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "客人，茶葉哪有論車買的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小......\n小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "又見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "交代給你的事，打聽得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "我們之前應該談妥了條件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "您說什麼......我不明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "這次進入玉門的商隊，其中有多少是拿著仿冒的通行文牒，這些文牒又是如何獲得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "我要更詳細的情報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "大小姐，您這次就放了我，等我回去的時候一定補繳這次的稅金！還有以前的！您就別問我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "你之前犯的事，可以以後再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "現在，先回答我的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "來、來人哪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "有人搶東西啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤憤不平的群眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "光天化日，還有這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "見義勇為的路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抓住她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "消耗我的耐心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門暗樁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "哎哎！大夥留神！我看到還有同夥往那邊跑啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "請問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "老闆不在，我幫忙看店。客人要打什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "打聽點事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "這裡是鐵匠鋪，你要是想聽故事，應該去客棧才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "可我聽說，有些江湖上的老故事，只有這裡才能聽到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "算了，我幹我的活，你隨便問，我就當找人閒聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "不白耽誤您的時間，照顧一下您的生意也是應該的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "打鐵鍋還是打菜刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "要是想打一把劍呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "不好意思，這個可做不了。這裡只做日常用品的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我沒看錯的話，這門口的招牌，寫的是鑄劍坊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "現在玉門城裡還掛著“鑄劍坊”牌子的，應該也就這一家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "其實就是個名字而已，要是老闆樂意，也可以叫它“品茗苑”“迎賓樓”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "說得也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "我說，你也是從外地來的遊客吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "對玉門的大漠風光慕名已久，一直想來看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "唉，每次和龍門對接的時候，都有一大批衝著武俠電視劇裡的故事來的遊客。稍微動動腦子，就該知道那都是騙人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "真不知道這個窮苦地方有什麼好來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "你想要打一把劍，也是想當旅遊紀念品？聽我一句勸，不如帶兩包玉門的風乾獸肉回去實在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "每個地方有每個地方的風光，多看看總是值得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "電視劇裡的故事是真是假我不清楚，但要說這家鐵匠鋪沒有故事，那我是一萬個不相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "信不信都由你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "無意冒犯，我剛才從外面的集市一路過來，家家鋪面都是客滿為患，唯獨這家......鐵匠鋪，門庭冷清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "一家沒有歷史也沒有生意的鋪子，不應該開在這麼繁華的街道上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "另外，一個真的沒有生意的鐵匠鋪，也不該點著這麼多爐子，備著這麼多鐵坯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "......我就不喜歡和心眼多的人說話，頭疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "多謝誇獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐵匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "想打聽什麼事，你問吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "本來是想向您打聽一點武林中的故事......聽了您剛才說的話，我又有了別的興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "不如請您講講，這家“鑄劍坊”，是怎麼變成“鐵匠鋪”的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人拼命的時候，總是跑得很快。\n眼見就要擺脫身後的人了，地面上卻彷彿憑空出現了一圈繩索將他絆倒。他掙扎著爬起來，只看到了細碎的流沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "折騰夠了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "（筋疲力盡的喘息）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "很好，那我們現在可以聊聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "你到底在害怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "小姐......這次的人，不一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "我要是說了......他們不會放過我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "大小姐......我還有家人，全家老小都指望我一個人，您不能這樣斷我生路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你還記得自己有家人。那你更不應該忘記，他們...\n...都在龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "林小姐，我知道您和鼠王的做事風格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "再怎麼說，您也不可能對他們做什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "這取決於你是否合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "還是說，一定要我證明一下，我不是那麼好說話的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "你知道些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "......每次龍門和玉門對接，混在其中的走私勢力是相對固定的，他們有穩定的通行證路子、貨源和分銷管道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "但這次突然多出來了一夥從沒見過的人，連資歷最老的走私犯也不清楚他們的來歷，有人嘗試過找麻煩......然後，那些人就消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "消失了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "是找麻煩的人消失了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "還知道什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "我好像聽說過，他們藏貨和銷贓的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "集市那邊擺平了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門暗樁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "鬧了點動靜出來，賠禮道歉嘛，熟得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍門暗樁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "text": "那這個人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "帶去軍營，等玉門這邊的事情結束了，再送回近衛局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的小販",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "大小姐！我知道的都已經招了！怎麼還——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "至少先送你去一個能保你安全的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "那人跑到這裡，突然就不見了蹤跡......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玉門的集市，是不常這樣熱鬧的。\n街上摩肩接踵，身邊帶著孩童的大人，也要將孩子的手拉得格外緊些。\n人山人海裡，要找一個特定的人，並不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "這位客人，您到底是來買東西的還是來找碴的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "讓一讓，讓一讓。不買東西就趕快讓開，杵在路中間幹嘛啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "商販的吆喝聲，遠處的爭吵聲，買賣的討價還價聲不絕於耳。置身這樣的環境，一些更危險且致命的聲響，往往很難被注意到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "有人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劍是從身後刺來的。\n沒有任何聲響的一劍，左樂幾乎是憑著本能向前避了一步。\n劍鋒刺破外衣，差一分，就會在後腰留下一道令他這輩子都無法直身行走的傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左樂轉過身去，眼前依舊是熙攘的集市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "（難道剛才那人是有意引我來這裡？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "（如果在這裡引起騷亂的話......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "（到底藏在哪......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "今日這集市可當真是熱鬧啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "鯉先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "左公子，這裡好像混入了些麻煩的人，當心些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "我注意到了，你也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "一點小障眼法，撐不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "這裡兇險，先脫身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "似乎也沒有別的辦法了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
